Customer  : Acme Ltd
Total     : 1240.00

--- HtmlRenderer ---
<h1>Invoice INV-1041</h1>
<tr><td>Customer</td><td>Acme Ltd</td></tr>
<tr><td>Total</td><td>1240.00</td></tr>

