  after two awaits       AsyncLocal='req-aaa'
  parallel child A       AsyncLocal='req-aaa'
  parallel child B       AsyncLocal='req-aaa'
  inside child           AsyncLocal='written-by-child'
  back in parent         AsyncLocal='req-aaa'  <- the child's write is NOT visible

request 2 (a separate logical flow keeps its own value):
  after two awaits       AsyncLocal='req-bbb'
  parallel child A       AsyncLocal='req-bbb'
  parallel child B       AsyncLocal='req-bbb'
  inside child           AsyncLocal='written-by-child'
  back in parent         AsyncLocal='req-bbb'  <- the child's write is NOT visible

[ThreadStatic] on a brand-new thread - guaranteed empty, while AsyncLocal flows:
